    "text": "Consider the following acids<br />\r<math><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mi></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math><br />\r<math><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mi></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math><br />\r<math><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mi></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math><br />\r<math><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mi></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></math><br />\rCorrect order of the rate of esterification of these acids with MeOH is",
